      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shame you are feeling is a heavy burden, but please remember that your worth is not defined by your financial status or current circumstances. Many people face immense struggles, and while it feels isolating right now, you are not the only one who has experienced such profound setbacks. Consider sharing your feelings with a therapist or counselor who can help you process this grief and rebuild your sense of self-worth privately. Showing vulnerability to a trusted professional is a powerful first step toward healing.",
