      "content": "If you are feeling like stopping is the only way to find peace, please know that these overwhelming feelings are a sign of deep pain, and you deserve help to navigate them. Please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline or mental health professional; they are available 24/7 to listen without judgment. You can call or text 988 anytime in the US and Canada to connect with someone right now. Please make that call; there is hope for relief from this pain.",
